    "result": "## Fix Complete\n\nThe bug is fixed. The issue was in the `gate` command handler in packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts. The `--ci` flag wasn't being forwarded to the underlying frai-gate CLI.\n\n**Changes made:**\n- Modified the `gate` command action handler to check `process.argv` for the `--ci` flag\n- If present, append `--ci` to the arguments passed to the frai-gate CLI\n- Rebuilt the frai package with `pnpm --filter frai build`\n\n**Verified:**\n- Running `frai gate init --ci` now correctly creates both:\n  - `FRAI-SPEC.md`\n  - `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`",
